	(text "GERBANG S5 — TVS: D20 CDSOT23-T24CAN (Bourns, SOT-23): 1=CANH, 2=CANL,\n  3=GND — array CAN-rated VRWM 24V (clamping ~40V; aman thd dominant 3,5V/\n  recessive 2,5V bus 5V + common-mode). TIDAK ada di lib resmi 9.0.2 ->\n  simbol custom plts-custom:TVS_CAN diturunkan programatik dari SM712_SOT23\n  (topologi pin identik — DN-S5-02). Terpasang dekat J_CAN (S9: <10 mm).\nTERMINASI: R49 120R 1% + JP_CAN_TERM (open default = OFF; tutup = 0R).\n  Bus PLTS pendek & single-master: default tanpa terminasi (S9 review\n  panjang kabel aktual saat commissioning).\nRS->GND LANGSUNG = high-speed mode (kontrak task spec §5 S5 — SLOPE ctl\n  tidak dipakai; netlabel CAN_RS tidak terpakai, netclass assignment lama\n  dibiarkan harmless). VREF (pin 5) NC — tanpa split-termination."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 20 138 0)
		(effects
			(font (size 1.27 1.27))
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "0fe5eb95-2a81-4d24-a2b8-b989aea65f2c")	)
	(text "U9 SN65HVD230DR (SOIC-8, 3,3V, TI): 1=TXD 2=GND 3=VCC 4=RXD 5=VREF\n  6=CANL 7=CANH 8=RS. TXD<-CAN_TX (GPIO25, TWAI TX), RXD->CAN_RX\n  (GPIO26). C70 100nF pin-adjacent. Standby/low-power TIDAK dipakai.\n  ESP32 TWAI driver terintegrasi (bit timing 500 kbps — konfig FW).\nJ_CAN = Phoenix MKDS-1,5-3 P5,08 (CANH/CANL/GND; SELV).\nS9: CANH/CANL DIRUTEKAN BERPASANGAN (length-matched, stub minimal\n  <25 mm), D20 <10 mm dari pin terminal, layer referensi DGND kontinu."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 20 163 0)
		(effects
			(font (size 1.27 1.27))
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "a26182d2-71e3-4528-8298-a7619d1c625a")	)
	(text "FW-SYNC: TWAI (CAN) ESP32 di GPIO25/26 — pin matrix remap valid;\n  dua node PLTS + inverter hybrid: bitrate 500 kbps standar PLTS.\n  Driver SJA1000-compat; filter HW utk ID telemetri.\nCatatan ERC: VREF NC (output tanpa beban — bukan pelanggaran);\n  label CAN_TX/CAN_RX kontrapart sheet 02 (U1 GPIO25/26)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 225 138 0)
		(effects
			(font (size 1.27 1.27))
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "327f209c-01cb-4119-9376-1a464f0b2066")	)
	(text_box "08_CAN — SN65HVD230 + TVS CDSOT23-T24CAN + terminasi jumper (S5).\nU9 SN65HVD230DR (SOIC-8, 3,3V): TXD<-CAN_TX (GPIO25), RXD->CAN_RX\n  (GPIO26), RS->DGND LANGSUNG (high-speed — kontrak; netlabel CAN_RS\n  tak terpakai), VCC +3V3 + C70 100nF, GND->DGND, VREF->NC.\nJ_CAN (CANH/CANL/GND, MKDS 5,08) -> D20 CDSOT23-T24CAN (custom\n  plts-custom:TVS_CAN, SOT-23 — DN-S5-02) -> R49 120R + JP_CAN_TERM\n  (open default). CANH/CANL berpasangan saat routing (S9).\nGATE S5: TVS di J_CAN; terminasi via jumper; pull-up RO ada (sheet 07)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 20 20 0)
		(size 190 38)
		(stroke (width 0) (type default))
		(fill (type none))
		(effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top))
		(uuid "3cc1ef8c-a4af-4fae-a07b-c1e184b452e1")
	)
